<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - SociaFusion</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@3.3.3/dist/tailwind.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-900 text-white font-sans leading-relaxed">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="bg-black py-6 shadow-md">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">SociaFusion</h1>
            <nav>
                <a href="/" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white px-4">Home</a>
                <a href="/about" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white px-4">About Us</a>
                <a href="/contact" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white px-4">Contact</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
        <!-- About Us Section -->
        <section class="mb-12">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-100">About SociaFusion</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8">
                At SociaFusion, we are dedicated to revolutionizing the way people connect and interact online. Founded with the vision of creating a comprehensive and engaging social platform, our mission is to bring together diverse communities and foster meaningful relationships.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8">
                Our platform is designed to offer a seamless user experience with features that include personalized feeds, media sharing, and interactive tools. We believe in the power of connection and strive to make every interaction count, whether it's through sharing your latest update, connecting with friends, or discovering new content.
            </p>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8">
                With a commitment to innovation and user satisfaction, SociaFusion is more than just a social media platform; it's a hub for creativity, engagement, and collaboration. We are passionate about providing a space where users can express themselves freely and connect with others who share their interests.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Our Team Section -->
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-100">Meet Our Team</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Team Member Card -->
                <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-100">Jane Doe</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">Founder & CEO</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Jane is the visionary behind SociaFusion, with a passion for technology and community building. Under her leadership, the platform has grown into a vibrant space for social interaction and engagement.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Team Member Card -->
                <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-100">John Smith</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">CTO</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">John leads our technical team with expertise in software development and system architecture. His focus on innovation ensures that SociaFusion remains at the cutting edge of social media technology.</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Team Member Card -->
                <div class="bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-lg">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-gray-100">Emily Johnson</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">Head of Marketing</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Emily drives our marketing strategies and user engagement initiatives. Her creative approach helps us connect with users and communicate our vision effectively.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-black py-6 mt-12">
        <div class="container mx-auto text-center text-gray-400">
            <p>&copy; 2024 SociaFusion. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
